OL,3,GNEWSAPM stands 'full square behind'
OL,4,AGood Friday Agreement
OL,5,
OL,6,FNorthern Ireland Secretary Sir Chris
OL,7,FBryant has said he and Prime Minister
OL,8,FAndy Burnham "stand full square" behind
OL,9,Fall of the Good Friday Agreement,
OL,10,Fincluding its provisions for a border
OL,11,Fpoll.
OL,13,FDuring his first visit to Northern
OL,14,FIreland on Thursday, Burnham said a
OL,15,Fborder poll was "off the table" and
OL,16,Fthat votes on Brexit and Scottish
OL,17,Findependence showed the "risks that
OL,18,Fcome from those situations take a long
OL,19,Ftime to heal".
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,414,410,260,120,0,100
