OL,3,GNEWSAPM stands 'full square behind'
OL,4,AGood Friday Agreement
OL,5,
OL,6,FHowever on Friday, Sir Chris said the
OL,7,Fpoint Burnham was making was that
OL,8,Fdiscussions for a border poll were "not
OL,9,Fon the table" during discussions on
OL,10,FThursday.
OL,12,F"He was not making a general statement
OL,13,Fabout the whole future of the Good
OL,14,FFriday Agreement," Sir Chris said.
